
		IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
		PROGRAM-ID. prog_a.
		DATA DIVISION.
		WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
		77  WS-STRINGA   PIC X(10).
		PROCEDURE DIVISION.
		    MOVE  "hi there"   TO WS-STRINGA
		    CALL  "prog_b"  USING WS-STRINGA
		    DISPLAY "back in prog_a"
		    GOBACK.


IFICATION DIVISION.
AM-ID. prog_b.
DIVISION.
NG-STORAGE SECTION.
S-STRINGB   PIC X(10).
S-CALLSB    PIC 9(03).
-STORAGE SECTION.
S-STRING  PIC X(10).
GE SECTION.
K-STRING  PIC X(10).

DURE DIVISION  USING  LK-STRING.
ISPLAY "entered prog_b"
DD   1  TO  WS-CALLSB
OVE  LK-STRING TO WS-STRINGB
OVE  LK-STRING TO LS-STRING
ISPLAY "exiting prog_b"
OBACK.